# {{ lab_name }} Cluster Access Guide

BM Server: `{{ _bm_ip }}` (root)

## Network Access from Laptop

The clusters use `198.51.100.x` IPs which are only routable inside the BM server. Use **sshuttle** to tunnel all traffic through SSH:

```bash
# Install (one-time)
python3 -m pip install sshuttle

# Connect — routes 198.51.100.0/24 through the BM server
sshuttle -r root@{{ _bm_ip }} 198.51.100.0/24 192.168.40.0/24
```

Keep this running in a terminal. All cluster URLs below will work directly from your browser and CLI.

