## OCP Management Cluster (SNO)

| | |
|---|---|
| **API** | `{{ _ocp_api.stdout }}` |
| **Console** | `https://{{ _ocp_console.stdout }}` |
| **User** | `kubeadmin` |
| **Password** | `{{ _ocp_kubeadmin.stdout }}` |
| **IP** | `{{ ocp_dnat_ip }}` |

### Copy kubeconfig to laptop

```bash
scp root@{{ _bm_ip }}:/root/.kube/config ~/.kube/ocp-{{ lab_name }}.yaml
export KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/ocp-{{ lab_name }}.yaml
oc whoami
```

### Login with oc CLI

```bash
oc login {{ _ocp_api.stdout }} \
  --username=kubeadmin \
  --password='{{ _ocp_kubeadmin.stdout }}' \
  --insecure-skip-tls-verify
```

