## Quick Status Checks

```bash
# From BM server (or laptop with sshuttle + kubeconfig)

# OCP management cluster
export KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/ocp-{{ lab_name }}.yaml
oc get nodes
oc get clusterversion
oc get co                          # cluster operators
oc get pods -n osac-system         # OSAC components
oc get hostedclusters -A -o wide   # CaaS cluster overview

# CaaS hosted cluster
export KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/caas-{{ lab_name }}.yaml
oc get nodes
oc get clusterversion
oc get co
```

