## Alternative Access (without sshuttle)

If sshuttle is not available:

```bash
# OCP console via port 9444 (already exposed by socat)
# Add to /etc/hosts:
# {{ _bm_ip }}  {{ _ocp_console.stdout }}
# Then browse: https://{{ _bm_ip }}:9444

# SSH SOCKS proxy (browser only)
ssh -D 1080 root@{{ _bm_ip }}
# Configure browser SOCKS5 proxy: localhost:1080
```
